| **Timestamp**        | Approximate creation time of the block |
| **Difficulty Target** | How hard it is to find a valid hash (adjusts over time) |
| **Nonce**            | A counter that miners change to search for a hash that meets the difficulty target |

The **body** of the block contains the list of transactions (e.g., “Alice sends 1 BTC to Bob”).

