| **Mystical / Transcendent** | There is an underlying unity or ultimate reality beyond the material world. | To realize one’s true self (atman, Buddha‑nature, the One) and merge with that reality. |
| **Nihilistic** | Life has no intrinsic meaning or value. | There is no meaning, so any meaning we find is ultimately arbitrary. |
| **Humanistic** | Human beings are the source of meaning; we should promote human flourishing. | To develop our capacities, help others, and leave the world a better place. |

