| **Proof‑of‑Stake (PoS)** | Validators lock up (“stake”) a amount of cryptocurrency. The protocol pseudo‑randomly selects a validator to propose the next block; others validate it. If they act honestly, they earn rewards; malicious behavior results in loss of stake. | Ethereum (post, Agreement=100.00%
