| – Hinduism | Soul’s ultimate goal is moksha (liberation). | *To realize one’s true self (Atman) and unite with Brahman.* |
| – Buddhism | End suffering through the Four Noble Truths. | *To attain enlightenment (nirvana) and escape the cycle of rebirth.* |
| – Judaism | Fulfill God’s covenant and live a life of moral law (mitzvot). | *To build a partnership with God and improve the world.* |
| **Secular / Scientific** | | |
| – Evolutionary biology | Life exists to propagate genes. | *Survival and reproduction of one’s lineage.* |
