Imagine a **Google Doc** that everyone can view but no one can delete or edit past versions. Every change is recorded with a timestamp, and the document is synced across thousands of computers in real-time.

---

### **Key Takeaway**
Blockchain solves the "double-spend problem" (digital files can be copied) without a bank. It creates trust in a trustless environment by combining cryptography, decentralization, and consensus.

